Okay.

873
00:34:37,150 --> 00:34:39,480
Besides tomatoes, see what else you want.

874
00:34:41,630 --> 00:34:43,159
Towels are three yuan each.

875
00:34:43,590 --> 00:34:44,060
Okay,

876
00:34:44,440 --> 00:34:45,360
I'll take four.

877
00:34:45,360 --> 00:34:46,090
Four towels?

878
00:34:47,230 --> 00:34:47,980
Ten yuan.

879
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,370
Twelve. Twelve.

880
00:34:49,550 --> 00:34:51,010
I'm buying so many at once.

881
00:34:51,760 --> 00:34:52,670
Ten yuan. Ten yuan.

882
00:34:52,670 --> 00:34:53,550
One of each color.

883
00:34:53,550 --> 00:34:54,440
I can't do ten yuan.

884
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:55,300
I really can't.

885
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:56,610
I can't.

886
00:34:56,780 --> 00:34:57,480
It's a small business.

887
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,710
Then I don't want them.

888
00:34:58,710 --> 00:34:59,770
Don't... Don't go.

889
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,280
I'll give you a free bar of soap.

890
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,440
This soap is worth two yuan.

891
00:35:02,440 --> 00:35:03,510
Four towels and a bar of soap

892
00:35:03,510 --> 00:35:03,840
for twelve yuan.

893
00:35:03,840 --> 00:35:04,610
Alright, alright, alright.

894
00:35:04,610 --> 00:35:04,940
Okay?

895
00:35:05,440 --> 00:35:06,680
This small business

896
00:35:06,710 --> 00:35:08,030
really doesn't make much,

897
00:35:08,030 --> 00:35:08,840
you know?

898
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:10,480
Okay.

899
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:12,510
Take care.

900
00:35:14,070 --> 00:35:15,470
Making this little money

901
00:35:15,630 --> 00:35:16,670
is really hard.

902
00:35:17,800 --> 00:35:18,550
If you ask me,

903
00:35:19,070 --> 00:35:20,810
no matter what you sell here,

904
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:22,040
you can't get a good price.

905
00:35:22,040 --> 00:35:23,190
In the provincial capital,

906
00:35:23,190 --> 00:35:23,920
a towel

907
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:25,450
can sell for dozens of yuan.

908
00:35:26,280 --> 00:35:27,740
Dozens of yuan is nothing.

909
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:29,260
Shanghai is even crazier.

910
00:35:30,150 --> 00:35:32,000
My daughter bought me a handkerchief

911
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:32,920
for one hundred and twenty yuan.

912
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,320
More precious than gold.

913
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:35,900
You're talking nonsense.

914
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:37,680
How could a handkerchief

915
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:39,230
cost one hundred and twenty?

916
00:35:39,230 --> 00:35:40,660
I'm not talking nonsense.

917
00:35:40,660 --> 00:35:41,460
I'll show you.

918
00:35:42,630 --> 00:35:44,760
Look, doesn't it say
one hundred and twenty?

919
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:45,360
See? There's the tag.

920
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:47,020
I couldn't bear to take it off.

921
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:47,670
Really.

922
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:49,130
It's very precious.

923
00:35:49,210 --> 00:35:50,280
Then you wouldn't dare use it.

924
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:51,610
Just display it at home.

925
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:53,050
Put it away quickly.

926
00:35:53,150 --> 00:35:54,680
Yeah, I need to keep it safe.

927
00:35:55,820 --> 00:35:57,420
Ma'am, you haven't paid yet.

928
00:35:58,070 --> 00:35:58,870
How much is it?

929
00:35:58,880 --> 00:35:59,590
Three yuan and ten cents.

930
00:35:59,590 --> 00:36:00,920
Just give me three yuan.

931
00:36:01,190 --> 00:36:01,720
Alright.

932
00:36:08,280 --> 00:36:08,810
Alright.

933
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:09,860
Come on, get on.

934
00:36:14,930 --> 00:36:17,460
What if
we move to the provincial capital too?

935
00:36:18,480 --> 00:36:19,880
The provincial capital?

936
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:22,570
I haven't even figured out Qingwu yet.

937
00:36:23,280 --> 00:36:24,880
If we really
went to the provincial capital,

938
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,730
I'd be sold

939
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,160
and still help them count the money.

940
00:36:27,160 --> 00:36:28,890
You know yourself pretty well.

941
00:36:30,510 --> 00:36:31,320
Are you saying

942
00:36:31,340 --> 00:36:32,670
we're going to spend our whole lives

943
00:36:32,670 --> 00:36:34,000
staying here in Qingwu,

944
00:36:34,190 --> 00:36:35,020
running a street stall?

945
00:36:35,020 --> 00:36:36,280
What's wrong with running a street stall

946
00:36:36,280 --> 00:36:37,630
in Qingwu for the rest of our lives?

947
00:36:37,630 --> 00:36:38,070
Look,

948
00:36:38,550 --> 00:36:39,750
these past few years,

949
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:41,450
even though it's been hard,

950
00:36:42,010 --> 00:36:42,800
we've managed to

951
00:36:42,800 --> 00:36:43,660
raise the kids.

952
00:36:44,110 --> 00:36:45,240
When the time comes,

953
00:36:45,710 --> 00:36:47,170
when one gets into college

954
00:36:47,590 --> 00:36:49,190
and the other makes the national team,

955
00:36:49,190 --> 00:36:50,360
our burden

956
00:36:51,030 --> 00:36:52,560
will be completely lifted.

957
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:55,000
When that time comes,

958
00:36:55,710 --> 00:36:57,030
why bother struggling?

959
00:36:57,030 --> 00:36:58,280
That's why I say

960
00:36:58,440 --> 00:36:59,700
you're short-sighted

961
00:37:00,030 --> 00:37:00,760
and thick-headed.

962
00:37:00,760 --> 00:37:02,760
You only see what's right in front of you.

963
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:05,150
Do you know how much
a year of college tuition is?

964
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:06,190
And when Qi Zhi

965
00:37:06,630 --> 00:37:07,630
gets married and buys a house,

966
00:37:07,630 --> 00:37:09,090
won't that all cost money?

967
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:10,280
As the saying goes,

968
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:12,510
a tree dies if moved,
but a person thrives.

969
00:37:12,510 --> 00:37:13,800
The provincial capital is so big,

970
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,560
there must be more opportunities.

971
00:37:15,560 --> 00:37:15,960
Right?

972
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:17,050
If you don't go out and try,

973
00:37:17,050 --> 00:37:17,560
how will you know

974
00:37:17,560 --> 00:37:18,600
if you can make it?

975
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:19,630
Besides,

976
00:37:19,630 --> 00:37:20,670
living here in Qingwu

977
00:37:20,670 --> 00:37:22,400
isn't exactly pleasant, is it?

978
00:37:22,710 --> 00:37:23,710
We see the Cao family

979
00:37:23,710 --> 00:37:25,170
every time we turn around.

980
00:37:25,230 --> 00:37:27,030
Let's just move somewhere else.

981
00:37:27,710 --> 00:37:28,710
It'll be quieter.

982
00:37:29,510 --> 00:37:30,510
What do you think?

983
00:37:31,030 --> 00:37:32,750
You're not discussing this with me.

984
00:37:32,750 --> 00:37:34,480
You're giving me an ultimatum.

985
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:35,850
What did you say?

986
00:37:38,230 --> 00:37:39,000
I mean,

987
00:37:39,080 --> 00:37:40,540
my wife makes a good point.

988
00:37:41,360 --> 00:37:42,840
My wife is far-sighted

989
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,400
and thinks ahead.

990
00:37:44,630 --> 00:37:46,890
This family really can't do without you.

991
00:37:47,360 --> 00:37:48,440
Then it's settled.

992
00:37:53,440 --> 00:37:55,220
Do you still want this tape recorder?

993
00:37:55,220 --> 00:37:55,950
Of course.

994
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:57,250
It would be a pity to throw it away.

995
00:37:57,250 --> 00:37:58,610
But you guys never listen to it.

996
00:37:58,610 --> 00:37:59,230
It's just sitting on the cabinet.

997
00:37:59,230 --> 00:38:00,280
I listen to it.

998
00:38:00,510 --> 00:38:00,840
Dad.

999
00:38:01,190 --> 00:38:03,720
What happened to our house?
Did we get robbed?

1000
00:38:04,320 --> 00:38:05,800
With the state of our house,

1001
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:07,000
if a thief really broke in,

1002
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:08,730
they might be the unlucky ones.

1003
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:09,960
We are moving.

1004
00:38:10,520 --> 00:38:11,450
I'll clean out

1005
00:38:11,480 --> 00:38:12,440
all this junk.

1006
00:38:12,710 --> 00:38:14,970
Sell what we can, and throw away the rest.

1007
00:38:15,070 --> 00:38:16,670
Move? Where are we moving to?

1008
00:38:16,670 --> 00:38:18,480
The provincial capital, Haizhou.

1009
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:19,280
To be closer to you.

1010
00:38:19,280 --> 00:38:19,780
So you don't have to travel

1011
00:38:19,780 --> 00:38:21,070
back and forth on weekends.

1012
00:38:21,070 --> 00:38:21,800
How about it?

1013
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:23,800
Surprised? Didn't see that coming?

1014
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:24,820
Not surprised,

1015
00:38:25,510 --> 00:38:26,360
but I didn't see it coming.

1016
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:26,960
Move this box

1017
00:38:26,960 --> 00:38:27,890
over here for me.

1018
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:28,710
Mom.

1019
00:38:29,330 --> 00:38:30,550
Our family has lived in Qingwu

1020
00:38:30,550 --> 00:38:31,380
since your grandfather's generation

1021
00:38:31,380 --> 00:38:32,010
for fifty or sixty years.

1022
00:38:32,010 --> 00:38:33,610
We can't just move like that.

1023
00:38:33,630 --> 00:38:34,280
Yeah.

1024
00:38:34,670 --> 00:38:36,530
Your grandfather and your father

1025
00:38:36,710 --> 00:38:37,710
were both miners.

1026
00:38:38,720 --> 00:38:39,890
They stayed here

1027
00:38:39,920 --> 00:38:41,380
to help build the country.

1028
00:38:41,630 --> 00:38:43,670
We haven't worked in the mine
for a long time.

1029
00:38:43,670 --> 00:38:45,330
Why are we still staying here?

1030
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:46,440
It's time to move.

1031
00:38:46,950 --> 00:38:47,360
Zhi.

1032
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:49,030
They say the provincial capital

1033
00:38:49,030 --> 00:38:51,160
is dozens of times bigger than Qingwu.

1034
00:38:51,670 --> 00:38:53,920
It takes hours to drive

1035
00:38:54,150 --> 00:38:55,550
from one end to the other.

1036
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:57,150
There's also an amusement park
and a Ferris wheel.

1037
00:38:57,150 --> 00:38:59,280
Have you ever been on a roller coaster?

1038
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:00,670
I'm going out for some fresh air.

1039
00:39:00,670 --> 00:39:02,730
Where are you going? It's time to eat.

1040
00:39:03,360 --> 00:39:04,220
I'm not eating.

1041
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:05,720
Aren't you going to pack?

1042
00:39:06,620 --> 00:39:07,550
Dad, look at him.

1043
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:09,360
He hides whenever there's work

1044
00:39:09,360 --> 00:39:10,030
and slacks off.

1045
00:39:10,030 --> 00:39:11,160
He's trained all day

1046
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:12,920
and then run all the way back.

1047
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:13,630
He's probably tired.

1048
00:39:13,630 --> 00:39:15,000
After his usual training,

1049
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:15,820
doesn't he run back too?

1050
00:39:15,820 --> 00:39:17,070
And doesn't he still have the energy

1051
00:39:17,070 --> 00:39:19,000
to go roller-skating
with his classmates at night?

1052
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:20,530
He doesn't look tired to me.

1053
00:40:29,760 --> 00:40:31,150
Son, don't scare me.

1054
00:40:31,150 --> 00:40:32,680
Where exactly does it hurt?

1055
00:40:32,840 --> 00:40:33,320
Is it here?

1056
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:34,150
Be gentle.

1057
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:37,920
-My stomach hurts.
-What have you done to yourself?

1058
00:40:37,920 --> 00:40:39,320
What did you eat?

1059
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:40,580
Stop twisting around.

1060
00:40:40,880 --> 00:40:41,360
Come on, son.

1061
00:40:41,360 --> 00:40:42,000
Get up and drink some water.

1062
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:43,200
Drink some hot water.

1063
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:46,440
Why are you

1064
00:40:46,510 --> 00:40:48,400
throwing up water?

1065
00:40:48,400 --> 00:40:49,660
What are we going to do?

1066
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:51,480
What should we do?

1067
00:40:52,120 --> 00:40:53,410
How about we go to

1068
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:55,770
a big hospital in the provincial capital?

1069
00:40:56,330 --> 00:40:57,590
You're about to compete

1070
00:40:57,590 --> 00:40:58,690
in the national team trials.

1071
00:40:58,690 --> 00:40:59,440
At this critical moment,

1072
00:40:59,440 --> 00:41:00,840
nothing else can go wrong.

1073
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:01,770
Alright, get up.

1074
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:02,670
We're going to the big hospital.

1075
00:41:02,670 --> 00:41:03,960
Let's go. Dad will carry you.

1076
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:04,730
Let's go. Come on, get up.

1077
00:41:04,730 --> 00:41:06,150
-Hold on.
-Dad, don't touch me.

1078
00:41:06,150 --> 00:41:07,030
When you touch me,

1079
00:41:07,030 --> 00:41:07,940
my stomach churns

1080
00:41:07,940 --> 00:41:09,070
and hurts even more.

1081
00:41:10,110 --> 00:41:10,590
You...

1082
00:41:10,590 --> 00:41:11,710
I can't take it anymore.

1083
00:41:11,710 --> 00:41:12,920
Let's call an ambulance.

1084
00:41:12,920 --> 00:41:13,760
Let's call an ambulance.

1085
00:41:13,760 --> 00:41:15,280
Here he is.

1086
00:41:15,630 --> 00:41:16,230
Qi Zhi.

1087
00:41:16,510 --> 00:41:18,910
Drink it.
You'll be fine after drinking it.

1088
00:41:19,670 --> 00:41:20,320
What is this?

1089
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,180
Don't spill it.

1090
00:41:21,480 --> 00:41:22,080
Medicine.

1091
00:41:22,330 --> 00:41:22,880
Magic medicine.

1092
00:41:22,880 --> 00:41:23,880
He can't drink it.

1093
00:41:24,150 --> 00:41:25,030
Who knows what the Caos

1094
00:41:25,030 --> 00:41:26,070
are up to?

1095
00:41:26,130 --> 00:41:27,300
Look at you.

1096
00:41:27,710 --> 00:41:28,510
What am I up to?

1097
00:41:28,510 --> 00:41:30,400
A selfless heart, a devoted heart,

1098
00:41:30,400 --> 00:41:31,730
and a heart full of love.

1099
00:41:32,070 --> 00:41:32,470
You...

1100
00:41:32,670 --> 00:41:33,360
Otherwise,

1101
00:41:33,630 --> 00:41:34,750
I'll drink some.

1102
00:41:35,070 --> 00:41:35,670
Okay?

1103
00:41:36,590 --> 00:41:37,710
Look at you.

1104
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:40,360
Let him try it.

1105
00:41:41,330 --> 00:41:42,450
Didn't he drink

1106
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:43,630
Doctor Cao's medicine when he was a kid?

1107
00:41:43,630 --> 00:41:44,670
How can you take medicine blindly?

1108
00:41:44,670 --> 00:41:46,150
Who will take responsibility
if it makes him worse?

1109
00:41:46,150 --> 00:41:48,010
We have nothing to lose by trying.

1110
00:41:50,230 --> 00:41:51,230
How do you feel?

1111
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:53,920
Dad.

1112
00:41:54,360 --> 00:41:54,920
Mom.

1113
00:41:55,800 --> 00:41:56,890
I have to say,

1114
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:59,500
I feel much better after drinking it.

1115
00:41:59,590 --> 00:42:00,190
Thank you, Grandpa Cao.

1116
00:42:00,190 --> 00:42:00,920
Much better?

1117
00:42:03,400 --> 00:42:05,190
An instant cure.

1118
00:42:07,340 --> 00:42:07,900
Then...

1119
00:42:07,960 --> 00:42:10,510
What disease does Qi Zhi have?

1120
00:42:10,710 --> 00:42:11,840
Well, Qi Zhi.

1121
00:42:13,190 --> 00:42:13,840
Aihua.

1122
00:42:14,960 --> 00:42:16,960
I think I just heard someone say

1123
00:42:17,710 --> 00:42:18,800
that I had bad intentions.

1124
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:19,800
Did you hear that?

1125
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:23,400
Qinglian is just worried.

1126
00:42:23,400 --> 00:42:24,100
Please bear with her.

1127
00:42:24,100 --> 00:42:25,350
Look at you.

1128
00:42:25,550 --> 00:42:26,510
What are you mumbling about?

1129
00:42:26,510 --> 00:42:27,970
Speak up. I can't hear you.

1130
00:42:30,510 --> 00:42:32,030
I mean, sir,

1131
00:42:32,710 --> 00:42:33,630
I'm sorry.

1132
00:42:33,960 --> 00:42:34,920
It's our fault.

1133
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:36,670
Look.

1134
00:42:37,030 --> 00:42:38,510
Aihua is a reasonable man.

1135
00:42:39,190 --> 00:42:39,790
Qinglian.

1136
00:42:39,920 --> 00:42:41,520
Is he saying he's sorry to me?

1137
00:42:44,330 --> 00:42:45,600
Qi Zhi's illness

1138
00:42:45,710 --> 00:42:47,510
is caused by spleen deficiency.

1139
00:42:48,030 --> 00:42:49,480
What does traditional Chinese medicine say?

1140
00:42:49,480 --> 00:42:50,670
In traditional Chinese medicine,

1141
00:42:50,670 --> 00:42:52,960
the spleen and stomach are
the foundation of acquired constitution.

1142
00:42:52,960 --> 00:42:54,710
If they are weak,

1143
00:42:54,880 --> 00:42:56,320
three turbidities can arise.

1144
00:42:56,320 --> 00:42:57,590
Over time.

1145
00:42:58,280 --> 00:42:59,000
Guess what?

1146
00:43:00,710 --> 00:43:02,480
The abdominal pain becomes unbearable.

1147
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:04,440
Then... then how do we treat it?
